<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="1000" height="260" viewBox="0 0 1000 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc">
<title id="title">Alpha illustrative rhythm, ${EXAMPLE_HZ} cycles per second, ${APPEARANCE} appearance</title>
<desc id="desc">Normalized one-second sinusoidal frequency illustration. Not recorded EEG, a pulse envelope or rendered audio. It uses the same representative rhythm as the combined spectrum.</desc>
<defs>${GLYPH_DEFINITIONS}</defs>
